    "title": "Independence could ban some teenagers from riding motorized bikes in most places - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Heidi Schmidt ,\n7 hours ago INDEPENDENCE, Mo. (KCTV) - Proposed changes regarding motorized bicycles in one city could make it illegal for some teenagers to ride them in many areas. Independence City Council introduced a proposed change to the city’s rules during a meeting earlier this week. The changes address safety involving motorized bicycles and e-scooters. Read full article\n2",
